    "title": "Country Balls: World Battle",
    "description": "In Country Balls: World Battle, you have to deal with a variety of challenges, strike bargains with other nations, build up your army's strength, and conquer new lands. Take charge of your own cell army and engage it in fierce combat!\r\n\r\nConquer the state and take control of the city! In this strategy game, use tactics and logic! Select a nation and guide it to triumph in the conflict throughout the map. Battle for every bit of territory in your state.\r\n\r\nFeatures of the game includes:\r\n- Customize your favorite country with a variety of hats, glasses and weapons.\r\n- Upgrade your army by increasing units and speed.\r\n- Use logic to come up with an ideal attack plan.\r\n- Command troops and army to conquer the world.\r\n\r\nRaise an army, guide soldiers into combat, and outsmart your opponents with logic. Are you prepared to rule the entire world? Download now for free!",
